{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "signal + bind 教学：下拉/滑杆/复选框/数字输入驱动 filter 变换与 size/opacity 通道，标题也是 signal",
  "width": 640,
  "height": 400,
  "padding": 8,

  "title": {
    "text": {
      "signal": "'西雅图每日天气 · ' + (weatherType === 'All' ? '全部类型' : weatherType) + ' · 风速 ≤ ' + format(windMax, '.1f') + ' m/s · 可见 ' + length(data('weather')) + ' 天'"
    },
    "fontSize": 14
  },

  "signals": [
    {
      "name": "weatherType",
      "value": "All",
      "bind": {
        "input": "select",
        "name": "天气类型：",
        "options": ["All", "drizzle", "rain", "sun", "snow", "fog"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "windMax",
      "value": 9.5,
      "bind": { "input": "range", "name": "风速上限 (m/s)：", "min": 0.5, "max": 9.5, "step": 0.1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "precipOnly",
      "value": false,
      "bind": { "input": "checkbox", "name": "只看降水日（precipitation > 0）：" }
    },
    {
      "name": "pointSize",
      "value": 80,
      "bind": { "input": "number", "name": "点大小 (size)：", "min": 20, "max": 400, "step": 20 }
    },
    {
      "name": "pointOpacity",
      "value": 0.7,
      "bind": { "input": "range", "name": "点不透明度：", "min": 0.1, "max": 1, "step": 0.05 }
    },
    {
      "name": "xDomain",
      "comment": "派生 signal：只有 update、没有 bind，专门给 data 驱动的 domain 兜底。domain 若直接写 {data:'weather'}，控件把 weather 过滤到 0 行时 scale 的 domain 会变成 [NaN, NaN]（刻度全消失 + 两条 Infinite extent WARN），只留下 1 行时又会零跨度（轴上只剩一个 '0.000000' 之类没格式化的标签）。这里改成表达式：表达式里的 extent([]) 是 [null, null]、span 为 0，所以 span(...) > 0 一个条件就同时挡掉这两种退化",
      "update": "span(extent(pluck(data('weather'), 'temp_max'))) > 0 ? extent(pluck(data('weather'), 'temp_max')) : [-5, 40]"
    },
    {
      "name": "yDomain",
      "comment": "y 的判据不同：因为 y 有 zero:true，只剩 1 行（比如 [5.8, 5.8]）会被补成 [0, 5.8]，不算退化；真正会退化的是「所有降水量都是 0」——sun / fog / drizzle 这三类天气从来不下雨，一选就是 [0, 0]。所以判 max > 0 即可（空集时 extent(...)[1] 是 null，null > 0 为 false，一并兜住）",
      "update": "extent(pluck(data('weather'), 'precipitation'))[1] > 0 ? extent(pluck(data('weather'), 'precipitation')) : [0, 60]"
    }
  ],

  "data": [
    {
      "name": "weather",
      "url": "../../assets/data/seattle-weather.csv",
      "format": {
        "type": "csv",
        "parse": { "precipitation": "number", "temp_max": "number", "temp_min": "number", "wind": "number" }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "type": "filter",
          "expr": "(weatherType === 'All' || datum.weather === weatherType) && datum.wind <= windMax && (!precipOnly || datum.precipitation > 0)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "scales": [
    {
      "name": "x",
      "type": "linear",
      "zero": false,
      "nice": true,
      "domain": { "signal": "xDomain" },
      "range": "width"
    },
    {
      "name": "y",
      "type": "linear",
      "zero": true,
      "nice": true,
      "domain": { "signal": "yDomain" },
      "range": "height"
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "ordinal",
      "domain": ["drizzle", "rain", "sun", "snow", "fog"],
      "range": "category"
    }
  ],

  "axes": [
    { "orient": "bottom", "scale": "x", "title": "日最高气温 temp_max (°C)", "grid": true, "gridOpacity": 0.2 },
    { "orient": "left", "scale": "y", "title": "降水量 precipitation (mm)", "grid": true, "gridOpacity": 0.2 }
  ],

  "legends": [
    { "fill": "color", "title": "weather（天气类型）", "orient": "right" }
  ],

  "marks": [
    {
      "name": "points",
      "type": "symbol",
      "from": { "data": "weather" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "stroke": { "value": "#ffffff" },
          "strokeWidth": { "value": 0.5 }
        },
        "update": {
          "x": { "scale": "x", "field": "temp_max" },
          "y": { "scale": "y", "field": "precipitation" },
          "fill": { "scale": "color", "field": "weather" },
          "size": { "signal": "pointSize" },
          "fillOpacity": { "signal": "pointOpacity" }
        },
        "hover": {
          "fillOpacity": { "value": 1 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "emptyHint",
      "comment": "空态提示：过滤到 0 行时给出说明文字。非空态下 text 求值为 ''，Vega 只留一个不含文字的空 <text> 元素，画面上看不见，也不影响任何刻度与图元",
      "type": "text",
      "encode": {
        "update": {
          "text": { "signal": "length(data('weather')) ? '' : '当前筛选条件下没有匹配的天数'" },
          "x": { "signal": "width / 2" },
          "y": { "signal": "height / 2" },
          "align": { "value": "center" },
          "baseline": { "value": "middle" },
          "fontSize": { "value": 14 },
          "fill": { "value": "#8a8f98" }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
